※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 5005 LANG_STMT_COMPARISON_DISCARDED

※ A comparison computes a truth value and does nothing else, so one whose
※ answer goes nowhere is a statement with no effect.  The last statement of a
※ body is the body's result, so the second one here is the point of the
※ function and only the first is reported.
let a: u8 = 1u8
let b: u8 = 2u8

@[startup]
fn main() → bool:
    a < b
    a > b
